license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CorneliusDorsogilaa/jubilee-openoil-reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code and derived analysis data for a stepwise OpenDrift/OpenOil
  process-attribution study at the Jubilee Field, Ghana, including ensemble,
  numerical-robustness, horizontal-diffusivity, vertical-depth, mechanism, and
  oil-record sensitivity analyses.
keywords:
  - OpenDrift
  - OpenOil
  - oil spill modelling
  - Jubilee Field
  - process attribution
  - vertical exchange
  - emulsification
